config SND_QIN1SPLUS_CAPTURE
	bool "Qin 1s+ SC9820E SC2721 PCM"
	depends on SND_DRIVERS && ARCH_SC9820E && OF && MFD_SC27XX_PMIC
	depends on AW87339=y
	select SND_PCM
	select MFD_SYSCON
	help
	  Capture the built-in MainMIC through SC2721 ADCL and SC9820E VBC
	  ADC0 using programmed I/O. The stream is 48 kHz, S16_LE, mono.
	  The fixed route owns the digital codec and VBC banks exclusively.
	  Digital stereo playback uses the same banks at 44.1 or 48 kHz,
	  S16_LE. Prepared speaker EQ6 and ALC apply at 44.1 kHz; the 48 kHz
	  path bypasses those processing blocks. Audio requires a prepared
	  target profile, including the built-in microphone gain.
	  Capture and playback are mutually exclusive. Playback prepares the
	  analog headphone path while muted and enables the external speaker
	  amplifier at START. A master volume controls both headphone gains.
